Try Alt-k. But number_pad is not supposed to be defined in the source -- its 
an option. You can set it from within the game by typing O s number_pad, or 
by putting it in your .nethackrc. If you are running under X, however, it 
may take some work to get NetHack to accept the number pad keys as numbers. 
